solution.p:
Find the slope by isolating y\text{:}
\begin{aligned}
{5x-7y} \amp= {35}\\
-7 y \amp= {35-5x}\\
y \amp= \frac{{35-5x}}{-7}\\
y \amp= {{\frac{5}{7}}x - 5}
\end{aligned}
So the slope is {{\frac{5}{7}}}\text{.}

